    "text" : "**Hazard symbol** | **Meaning** | Description\n![copy-of-health-hazard](assets/144c3c698db3-copy-of-health-hazard.png) | Health hazard | includes warning on skin rashes, eye damage and ingestion\n![copy-of-corrosive](assets/fc0dfe09c635-copy-of-corrosive.png) | Corrosive | can cause skin burns and permanent eye damage\n![copy-of-flammable](assets/7583ff6307bc-copy-of-flammable.png) | Flammable | can catch fire if heated or comes into contact with a flame\n![copy-of-acute-toxicity](assets/b5fa8920a652-copy-of-acute-toxicity.png) | Acute toxicity | can cause life-threatening effects, even in small quantities\n![GHS hazard pictogram: black flame over a circle on white background in red diamond, indicating oxidising chemical substance or mixture](assets/bbee164c3fe3-58922-oxidising-hazard-symbol.png) | Oxidising | can supply oxygen to fuel fires or cause explosions\n![GHS hazard pictogram showing a dead tree and fish inside a red diamond, indicating a substance dangerous to aquatic life and the environment](assets/5b584955df0a-51769-environmental-hazard-symbol.png) | Dangerous to the environment | can cause lasting harm to aquatic life and ecosystems\n![GHS hazard pictogram: human silhouette with starburst on chest inside red diamond, indicating serious long-term health hazards like carcinogenicity](assets/cb350f4bb2f3-53011-health-hazard-symbol.png) | Health hazard | can indicate carcinogenic, mutagenic or reproductive hazards\n![GHS compressed gas hazard symbol: black gas cylinder icon in a white diamond with a thick red border on a plain white background](assets/60baae647762-7433-gas-under-pressure-hazard-symbol.png) | Gas under pressure | can explode if heated or release gas rapidly if the container is damaged\n![GHS hazard pictogram showing exploding bomb symbol inside a red diamond, indicating explosive or self-reactive substances and risk of violent explosion](assets/b317ba4b9d65-60709-explosive-hazard-symbol.png) | Explosive | can explode through shock, friction or exposure to heat",
